   "text": "Viewers vanish in the first minutes: E1 had 67.4 of every 100 watching near the start but only 11.8 left at the 2% mark; E2 kept 14.9. The biggest exit came roughly 7 minutes into E1, when 8 of every 100 left during the 'still figuring it out' preamble.",
